1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,220
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:10,530
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - because people

3
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:14,790
agreements are mutual, contracts feel one-sided.

4
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:21,070
Don't say customer, instead say client - clients feel like partners, customers feel

5
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,290
like numbers.

6
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:29,160
Don't say buy, instead say invest - people invest in value, not purchases.

7
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:34,810
Don't say maybe, instead say absolutely - certainty closes, maybe kills.

8
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:40,940
Don't say problem, instead say concern - concerns get solved, problems get blamed.

9
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:45,220
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

10
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:49,070
Comment 'TOOL' and I will send you the full list.

11
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:53,040
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
